  "body": "Wake each day to breathtaking panoramic views across the waterways, Gulf Harbour Marina and out towards the City. Positioned on the fourth floor with no stairs to climb, this exceptional apartment offers an enviable waterfront lifestyle with the convenience of single-level living and elevator access.\r\n\r\nWidely regarded as one of the most desirable apartments within the area, this home enjoys a rare aspect and elevated position that captures some of the finest views in the village. Whether you're relaxing with your morning coffee on the roadside balcony or unwinding in the afternoon sun with a glass of wine on the waterfront verandah, you'll love watching the ever-changing marina activity and sea life from the comfort of your own home.\r\n\r\nDesigned for effortless living, the spacious 140sqm (approx.) layout offers generous open-plan living, beautifully presented with a fresh, contemporary feel. The apartment features near-new bathrooms and has been meticulously renovated and maintained. Adding to its appeal is the highly sought-after private double garage with internal access and a lockable storage cupboard at ground level.\r\n\r\nThe proactive Body Corporate ensures the complex is kept to an exceptional standard, giving owners complete peace of mind.\r\nBody Corporate fees cover: ongoing exterior maintenance and upgrades, water usage, building insurance etc\r\n\r\nWhile this apartment does not include a marina berth, berths are available to rent and currently to buy within the complex making it an ideal option for boating enthusiasts. Buying options currently include a 12 and 14m berth.\r\n\r\nThis is a rare opportunity to secure one of the Marine Village's premier waterfront apartments, combining spectacular views, privacy, generous proportions and a truly low-maintenance lifestyle.",
